abstract: "Claim-bounded active-particle feedback surrogate package for noise-window diagnostics, feedback-geometry dependence, frustration-boundary classification, and rescue-stability audits. This repository does not claim experimental active-matter validation, biological/social-system validation, crowd-control or civilization-engineering utility, a universal kinetic-arrest/annealing mechanism, or local feedback as a uniquely necessary annealing generator."
